 be shielded again for $6788d.','','','','立即为队友加上魔法护盾，可吸收$s1点伤害，持续$d。只要护盾存在，受保护者的施法就不会被物理攻击打断。目标在被加上护盾之后的$6788d内无法再被加上护盾。','','','Absorbs damage.','','','','吸收伤害。','',''),(593,'Shadow Word: Fumble','','','','暗言术：拙','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','A word of darkness that reduces the target\'s chance to hit by $s1% for $d.','','','','黑暗的咒语，使目标的命中率降低$s1%，持续$d。','','','','','','','','',''),(594,'Shadow Word: Pain','','','','暗言术：痛','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','A word of darkness that causes $o1 Shadow damage over $d.','','','','黑暗的咒语，在$d内造成总计$o1点暗影伤害。','','','$s1 Shadow damage every $t1 seconds.','','','','每$t1秒$s1点暗影伤害。','',''),(595,'Prayer of Protection','','','','防护祷言','','','','','','','','','','Increase party\'s armor until duration expires or the priest stops praying.','','','','提高队友的护甲值，直到法术生效期结束，或者牧师终止祈祷。','','','','','','','','',''),(596,'Prayer of Healing','','','','治疗祷言','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','A powerful prayer heals party members within $a1 yards for $s1.','','','','强大的祷言，可以治疗附近半径$a1码范围内的所有小队成员。','','','','','','','','',''),(597,'Conjure Food','','','','造食术','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Conjures $s1 $lloaf:loaves; of bread, providing the mage and $ghis:her; allies with something to eat.\n\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.','','','','用魔法合成$s1块魔法面包以供法师和$g他:她;的盟友食用。\n\n这些物品会在持有者登出游戏超过15分钟之后消失。','','','','','','','','',''),(598,'Smite','','','','惩击','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Smite an enemy for $s1 Holy damage.','','','','对单体目标造成$s1点神圣伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(599,'Holy Word: Might','','','','圣言术：力','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Holy might infuses the target increasing their strength by $s1 for $d.','','','','圣洁的能量充满目标全身，令其力量提高$s1点，持续$d。','','','','','','','','',''),(600,'Power Word: Shield','','','','真言术：盾','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Draws on the soul of the party member to shield them, absorbing $s1 damage.  Lasts $d.  While the shield holds, spellcasting will not be interrupted by damage.  Once shielded, the target cannot be shielded again for $6788d.','','','','立即为队友加上魔法护盾，可吸收$s1点伤害，持续$d。只要护盾存在，受保护者的施法就不会被物理攻击打断。目标在被加上护盾之后的$6788d内无法再被加上护盾。','','','Absorbs damage.','','','','吸收伤害。','',''),(601,'Sword Mastery','','','','剑类武器掌握','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Increases your attack rating with One-Handed Swords by $s1.','','','','使你的单手剑的攻击力提高$s1点。','','','','','','','','',''),(602,'Inner Fire','','','','心灵之火','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','A burst of Holy energy fills the caster, increasing armor by $s1 and attack power by $s2.  Each melee or ranged damage hit against the priest will remove one charge.  Lasts $d or until $n charges are used.','','','','圣洁的能量充满施法者的体内，使$g他:她;的防御值提高$s1点。每次近战或远程伤害都会使牧师消耗一次防护能量。效果可持续$d，或在$n次防护之后消失。','','','Increases armor by $s1.','','','','防御值提高$s1点。','',''),(603,'Curse of Doom','','','','厄运诅咒','','','','','','','','','','Curses the target with impending doom, causing $s1 Shadow damage after $d.  If the target dies from this damage, there is a chance that a Doomguard will be summoned.  Cannot be cast on players.','','','','对目标施加终极的诅咒，在$d后造成$s1点暗影伤害。如果目标死于该伤害，则有一定几率召唤出一个末日守卫来。无法对玩家施放。','','','Causes $s1 Shadow damage after $d.','','','','在$d后造成$s1点暗影伤害。','',''),(604,'Dampen Magic','','','','魔法抑制','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Dampens magic used against the targeted party member, decreasing damage taken from spells by up to $s1 and healing spells by up to $s2.  Lasts $d.','','','','降低施放于目标小队成员身上的魔法效果，使其受到的法术伤害降低最多$s1点，治疗法术恢复生命值的效果降低最多$s2点，持续$d。','','','Reduces magic damage taken by up to $s1 and healing by up to $s2.','','','','降低法术伤害，最多$s1点。\n降低法术治疗效果，最多$s2点。','',''),(605,'Mind Control','','','','精神控制','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Controls a humanoid mind up to level $s1, but increases the time between its attacks by $s3%.  Lasts up to $d.','','','','控制一个最高等级为$s1的人型目标，但是使其攻击间隔延长$s3%。最多持续$d。','','','Charmed.  Time between attacks increased by $s3%.','','','',