r Attack Power.  Must be stealthed and behind the target.  Awards $s2 combo $lpoint:points;.','','','','猛勒敌人的脖子，在$d内对其造成总计$o1点伤害，该伤害会受到攻击强度的加成影响。必须在潜行状态下从目标背后发动。奖励$s2个连击点数。','','','$s1 damage every $t1 seconds.','','','','每$t1秒$s1点伤害。','',''),(704,'Curse of Recklessness','','','','鲁莽诅咒','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Curses the target with recklessness, increasing melee attack power by $s1 but reducing armor by $s2 for $d.  Cursed enemies will not flee and will ignore Fear and Horror effects.  Only one Curse per Warlock can be active on any one target.','','','','给目标施加鲁莽的诅咒，使其近战攻击强度提高$s1点，但护甲降低$s2点，持续$d。被诅咒的敌人不会逃跑，也不会受到恐惧的影响。每个术士只能对一个目标施加一种诅咒，且同类诅咒不能叠加。','','','Increases melee attack power by $s1 and decreases armor by $s2.   Target will not flee and will ignore Fear and Horror effects.','','','','近战攻击强度提高$s1点，护甲降低$s2点。目标不会逃跑，且免疫恐惧效果。','',''),(705,'Shadow Bolt','','','','暗影箭','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Sends a shadowy bolt at the enemy, causing $s1 Shadow damage.','','','','向目标射出一支暗影箭，对其造成$s1点暗影伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(706,'Demon Armor','','','','魔甲术','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Protects the caster, increasing armor by $s1, Shadow resistance by $s2 and restores $s3 health every 5 sec. for $d.','','','','使施法者的护甲提高$s1点，暗影抗性提高$s2点，同时每5秒回复$s3点生命值，持续$d。','','','Increases armor by $s1, Shadow resistance by $s2 and restores $s3 health every 5 sec.','','','','护甲值提高$s1点，暗影抗性提高$s2点，每5秒回复$s3点生命值。','',''),(707,'Immolate','','','','献祭','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Burns the enemy for $s2 Fire damage and then an additional $o1 Fire damage over $d.','','','','灼烧敌人，对其造成$s2点火焰伤害，并在$d内造成额外的$o1点火焰伤害。','','','$s1 Fire damage every $t1 seconds.','','','','每$t1秒$s1点火焰伤害。','',''),(708,'Spellstone Purge','','','','zzOLDSpellstone Purge','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(709,'Drain Life','','','','吸取生命','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Transfers $s1 health every second from the target to the caster.  Las