ers\' movement to $6136s2%, and increases the time between their attacks by $6136s1%.','','','','使护甲提高$s1点。如果敌人使用近战武器攻击施法者，他们的移动速度就有可能降低$6136s2%，攻击间隔延长$6136s1%，持续$d。','','','Armor increased by $s1.\nSlowing melee attackers\' movement and attacks.','','','','护甲提高$s1点。\n降低近战攻击者的移动和攻击速度。','',''),(12545,'Spitelash','','','','恶鞭','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Physical damage taken is increased by $s1.','','','','受到物理攻击时所承受的伤害提高$s1点。','',''),(12546,'Spitelash','','','','恶鞭','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(12548,'Frost Shock','','','','冰霜震击','','','','','','','','','','Inflicts Frost damage to an enemy and reduces its movement speed for $d.','','','','对敌人造成冰霜伤害，并使其移动速度降低，持续$d。','','','Reduced movement speed.','','','','移动速度降低。','',''),(12549,'Forked Lightning','','','','叉状闪电','','','','','','','','','','Inflicts Nature damage to enemies in a cone in front of the caster.','','','','对施法者面前一个锥形区域中的敌人造成自然伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(12550,'Lightning Shield','','','','闪电之盾','','','','','','','','','','Surrounds the caster with $n balls of lightning that have $h% chance of striking melee or ranged attackers for $s1 damage. Each time the lightning shield strikes, a ball of lightning dissipates. Thus, the shield expires after $d. or after it has struck $n times.','','','','$n颗闪电球环绕着施法者，有$h%的几率对近战或远程攻击者造成$s1点伤害。每次闪电之盾发动反击都会消耗一颗闪电球。因此，闪电之盾最多可维持$d，或者在反击$n次后消失。','','','$h% chance of inflicting $s1 Nature damage on hit.','','','','有$h%的几率在击中敌人时对其造成$s1点自然伤害。','',''),(12551,'Frost Shot','','','','冰霜射击','','','','','','','','','','Shoots at an enemy, inflicting $s1 additional Frost damage and slowing its movement by $s2% for $d.','','','','射击目标，对其造成$s1点额外的冰霜伤害，并使其移动速度降低$s2%，持续$d。','','','Movement speed reduced by $s2%.','','','','移动速度降低$s2%。','',''),(12552,'Cripple','','','','残废术','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(12553,'Shock','','','','震击','','','','','','','','','','Instantly throws a bolt of lightning at an enemy, inflicting Nature damage.','','','','立即向目标射出一支闪电箭，对其造成自然伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(12554,'Summon Treasure Horde','','','','召唤寻宝部落','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(12555,'Pummel','','','','拳击','','','','','','','','','','Pummels an enemy for $s1 damage and interrupts the spell being cast for $d.','','','','击打目标，对其造成$s1点伤害，并且使其在$d内不能施法。','','','','','','','','',''),(12556,'Frost Armor','','','','霜甲术','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(12557,'Cone of Cold','','','','冰锥术','','','','','','','','','','Inflicts Frost damage to enemies in a cone in front of the caster, reducing their movement speed for $d.','','','','对施法者面前一个锥形区域内的敌人造成冰霜伤害，并降低他们的移动速度，持续$d。','','','Reduced movement speed.','','','','移动速度降低。','',''),(12559,'Improved Fire Ward','','','','zzOLDImproved Fire Ward','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
