OYED and will not be retrievable.','','','','从优质（绿色）或更好的武器或护甲中提炼出其中的魔法元素，在这个过程中该武器或护甲会被摧毁。','','','','','','','','',''),(13278,'Gnomish Death Ray','','','','侏儒死亡射线','','','','','','','','','','The devices charges over time using your life force and then directs a burst of energy at your opponent.','','','','这件设备可以将你的生命能量以强力冲击波的形式发射出去，攻击你的敌人。','','','Charging death ray using your life force.','','','','使用你的生命能量为死亡射线充能。','',''),(13279,'Gnomish Death Ray','','','','侏儒死亡射线','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(13280,'Gnomish Death Ray','','','','侏儒死亡射线','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(13281,'Earth Shock','','','','地震术','','','','','','','','','','Shocks an enemy with concussive force, inflicting Nature damage and interrupting the spell being cast for $d.','','','','以震撼性的力量攻击目标，对其造成$s1点自然伤害，并使其在$d内不能施法。','','','','','','','','',''),(13298,'Poison','','','','毒药','','','','','','','','','','Inflicts Nature damage to an enemy every $t1 sec. for $d.','','','','每$t1秒对目标造成一次自然伤害，持续$d。','','','Nature damage inflicted every $t1 sec.','','','','每$t1秒受到一次自然伤害。','',''),(13299,'Poison Proc','','','','Poison Proc','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(13318,'Rend','','','','撕裂','','','','','','','','','','Wounds the target causing them to bleed for $o1 damage over $d.','','','','使目标的伤口不断流血，在$d内造成累计$o1点伤害。','','','Bleeding for $s1 damage every $t1 sec.','','','','因流血受到每$t1秒$s1点伤害。','',''),(13319,'Malfunction','','','','故障','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(13320,'Malfunction','','','','故障','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(13321,'Mana Burn','','','','法力燃烧','','','','','','','','','','Hits an enemy with an anti-mana bolt. For each point of mana consumed by the bolt, the target takes $e1 damage.','','','','向敌人射出一支可抽取法力值的箭，每抽取1点法力值，目标就受到$e1点伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(13322,'Frostbolt','','','','寒冰箭','','