stone can be used to store one target\'s soul.  If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with $20758s1 health and $20758q1 mana.\n\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.','','','','制造一块次级灵魂石，可以用来保存一个目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被保存期间死去，则他可以依靠灵魂石复活，并恢复$20758s1点生命值和$20758q1点法力值。\n\n如果持有该物品的玩家退出游戏超过15分钟，则该物品就会消失。','','','','','','','','',''),(20753,'Demoralizing Roar','','','','挫志咆哮','','','','','','','','','','Reduces the melee attack power of nearby enemies by $s1 for $d.','','','','使附近敌人的攻击强度降低$s1点，持续$d。','','','Melee attack power reduced by $s1.','','','','近战攻击强度降低$s1点。','',''),(20754,'Rain of Fire','','','','火焰之雨','','','','','','','','','','Calls down a molten rain, burning all enemies in a selected area for $s1 Fire damage every $t1 sec. for $d.','','','','召唤火焰之雨，对指定区域中的敌人每$t1秒造成$s1点伤害，持续$d。','','','$s1 Fire damage inflicted every $t1 sec.','','','','每$t1秒$s1点火焰伤害。','',''),(20755,'Create Soulstone','','','','制造灵魂石','','','','','','','','','','Creates a Soulstone.  The Soulstone can be used to store one target\'s soul.  If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with $20759s1 health and $20759q1 mana.\n\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.','','','','制造一块灵魂石，可以用来保存一个目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被保存期间死去，则他可以依靠灵魂石复活，并恢复$20759s1点生命值和$20759q1点法力值。\n\n如果持有该物品的玩家退出游戏超过15分钟，则该物品就会消失。','','','','','','','','',''),(20756,'Create Soulstone (Greater)','','','','制造强效灵魂石','','','','','','','','','','Creates a Greater Soulstone.  The Soulstone can be used to store one target\'s soul.  If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with $20760s1 health and $20760q1 mana.\n\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.','','','','制造一块强效灵魂石，可以用来保存一个目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被保存期间死去，则他可以依靠灵魂石复活，并恢复$20760s1点生命值和$20760q1点法力值。\n\n如果持有该物品的玩家退出游戏超过15分钟，则该物品就会消失。','','','','','','','','',''),(20757,'Create Soulstone (Major)','','','','制造特效灵魂石','','','','','','','',''