e Riding Bear','','','','白色战熊','','','','','','','','','','Summons and dismisses a rideable Bear. Speed is increased based on your Riding skill.','','','','召唤或解散一头可供骑乘的熊。根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45009,'Black Riding Bear','','','','黑色战熊','','','','','','','','','','He\'s big, he\'s ready for battle, and he\'s a bear. What more could you want in a mount?','','','','他很大，他已经做好了战斗的准备，而且他是一只熊。您还想要什么？','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45010,'Ash Riding Bear','','','','灰色战熊','','','','','','','','','','Summons and dismisses a rideable Bear. Speed is increased based on your Riding skill.','','','','召唤或解散一头可供骑乘的熊。根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45011,'Dark Brown Riding Bear','','','','深棕色战熊','','','','','','','','','','Summons and dismisses a rideable Bear. Speed is increased based on your Riding skill.','','','','召唤或解散一头可供骑乘的熊。根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45012,'Snowy Riding Bear','','','','雪色战熊','','','','','','','','','','Summons and dismisses a rideable Bear. Speed is increased based on your Riding skill.','','','','召唤或解散一头可供骑乘的熊。根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45013,'Brown Riding Bear','','','','棕色战熊','','','','','','','','','','He\'s big, he\'s ready for battle, and he\'s a bear. What more could you want in a mount?','','','','他很大，他已经做好了战斗的准备，而且他是一只熊。您还想要什么？','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45014,'Enchanted Broom','','','','魔法扫帚','','','','','','','','','','Created by a high elf apprentice, this broom would be extremely useful if anyone could figure out how to make it stop.','','','','这把扫帚是由一名高等精灵学徒创造的，如果有人能弄清楚如何让它停下来的话，它将非常有用。','','','','','','','','',''),(45015,'Thalassian Tender','','','