','','','','',''),(45023,'Cheeky Monkey','','','','顽皮猴子','','','','','','','','','','The monkeys of Azeroth are infamous tricksters, and these beloved companions of the Darkmoon Faire have taken that innate cunning to a whole new level.','','','','艾泽拉斯的猴子是臭名昭著的骗子，这些暗月马戏团心爱的伙伴将它们与生俱来的狡猾提升到了一个全新的水平。','','','','','','','','',''),(45024,'Food','','','','进食','','','','','','','','','','Restores $o1 health over $d.  Must remain seated while eating.  If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 25 Stamina for $24799d.','','','','在$d内恢复总计$o1点生命值，进食时必须保持坐姿。如果你花费至少10秒钟来进食，你的耐力将提高25点，持续$24799d。','','','Restores $/5;s1 health per second.','','','','每秒恢复$/5;s1点生命值。','',''),(45025,'Female Elven Mage Form','','','','女性精灵法师形态','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45026,'Female Elven Hunter Form','','','','女性精灵猎手形态','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45027,'Female Elven Child Form','','','','女性精灵儿童形态','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45028,'Summon Scarlet Warhorse','','','','召唤血色军马','','','Summon','','','','召唤','','','Summons a warhorse, which serves as a mount. Speed is increased based on your Riding skill.','','','','召唤一匹战马，作为坐骑。根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据骑术技能提高速度。','',''),(45029,'Summon Scarlet Charger','','','','召唤血色战马','','','Summon','','','','召唤','','','Summons a Charger, which serves as a mount. Speed is increased based on your Riding skill.','','','','召唤一个充电器，用作坐骑。根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据骑术技能提高速度。','',''),(45030,'Summon Spectral Fox','','','','召唤幽灵狐','','','','','','','','','','Summons a Fox to fight for you for $d.','','','','召唤一只幽灵狐为你战斗，持续时间$d。','','','','','','','','',''),(45031,'Summon Arcane Elemental','','','','召唤奥术元素','','','','','','','','','','In case of darkness, this little elemental is an infinite source of a soothing blue glow.','','','','在黑暗的情况下，这个小元素是舒缓蓝色光芒的无限来源。','','','','','','','','',''),(45032,'Swift Red Ram','','','','迅捷红色战羊','','','','','','','','','','Wildhammer Fact Checker claims that this specific breed was the first type of ram domesticated by the dwarves when they settled in Dun Morogh.','','','','蛮锤事实核查者声称，这种特定品种是矮人定居丹莫罗时驯化的第一种公羊。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据骑术技能提高速度。','',''),(45033,'Swift Brewfest Ram','','','','迅捷美酒节战羊','','','','','','','','','','Dwarves attribute this breed\'s even temperament to rigorous training, but other races argue that a daily diet of strong ale has something to do with it.','','','','矮人将这个品种的均匀性情归因于严格的训练，但其他种族则认为这与每天喝烈性啤酒有关。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据骑术技能提高速度。','',''),(45034,'Brewfest Ram','','','','美酒节战羊','','','','','','','','','','Brewers retired this mount from active advertising service after complaints that the beasts were \"too temperamental\" to control in major cities.','','','','在抱怨这些野兽“脾气太暴躁”而无法在大城市中控制后，酿酒商从积极的广告服务中退役了这匹坐骑。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据骑术技能提高速度。','',''),(45035,'Flaxen Riding Saber','','','','亚麻色利刃豹','','','','','','','','','','Night elves once believed that seeing this light colored saber breed in the wild was an ill omen.','','','','暗夜精灵曾经相信，在野外看到这种浅色的剑品种是一种不祥的预兆。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45036,'Swift Darnassian Nightsaber','','','','迅捷达纳苏斯夜刃豹','','','','','','','','','','When a night elf\'s mount perishes, it is custom for the rider to keep one of the saber\'s great fangs as a token of remembrance.','','','','当暗夜精灵的坐骑死去时，骑手会按照惯例保留其中一根军刀的巨大尖牙作为纪念。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(45037,'Swift Horde Worg','','','','迅捷部落座狼','','','','','','','','','','If asked to fetch, will most likely bring you back the head of a small mammal or humanoid.','','','','如果被要求去取，很可能会带回小型哺乳动物或人形生物的头部。','','','Inc