'','','','','','','Your damaging spells have a 4% chance to inflict the target with a disease that causes 120 Shadow damage over 6 sec. Damage caused by the disease heals you.','','','','你的伤害性法术有 4% 的几率使目标罹患疾病，在 6 秒内造成 120 点暗影伤害。疾病造成的伤害可以治愈你。','','','','','','','','',''),(45502,'Ethereal Form','','','','灵体形态','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Makes the Shaman take $s1% less physical damage, but unable to cast spells for $d.','','','','使萨满祭司受到的物理伤害减少$s1%，期间无法施法，持续$d。','','','Walking with the spirits.','','','','与灵魂同行。','',''),(45503,'Big Bad Voodoo','','','','终极巫毒','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Channels the power of the spirits, rendering nearby party members immune to all damage and effects for $d. Does not affect the caster.','','','','引导灵魂的力量，使附近除施法者以外的团队成员免疫所有伤害和效果，持续$d。','','','We be jammin\'!','','','','我们被干扰了！','',''),(45504,'Hex','','','','妖术','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Transforms the enemy into a frog that cannot cast, and does $s3% less damage for up to $d. Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.','','','','将敌人变成一只青蛙，使其无法施法，并减少$s3%的伤害，最多持续$d。只能对野兽、人型生物和小动物使用。','','','Cannot cast spells and damage reduced by $s3%.','','','','沉默，伤害降低$s3%。','',''),(45505,'Feral Spirit','','','','野性狼魂','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Summons two Spirit Wolves under the command of the Shaman for $d.','','','','召唤两只幽灵狼为萨满祭司作战，持续$d。','','','','','','','','',''),(45506,'Earthquake','','','','地震术','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Creates a violent earthquake in the target area causing $s1 Physical damage to enemies every $t1 sec, and reducing their speed by $s2% in an 8 yard radius.  Lasts $d.  Shaman must channel to maintain the spell.','','','','在目标区域制造强烈地震，每$t1秒对8码半径内的敌人造成$s1点物理伤害，并使敌人速度降低$s2%。持续$d。萨满必须引导才能维持法术。','','','$s1 damage every $t1 seconds, and reducing speed by $s2%.','','','','每$t1秒造成$s1点伤害，并降低$s2%的速度。','',''),(45508,'Thunderhead','','','','雷暴','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Allows your Lightning Shield to be cast on allie