he Shaman at any one time.','','','','施法者被土盾包围，施法时有$s2%的几率不会延长施法时间，受到攻击时恢复$45526s1点生命值。间隔数秒触发一次，最多生效$n次，持续$d。同时只能存在一个元素护盾。','','','$s2% chance to ignore spell interruption when damaged and attacks heal the Shaman for $45526s1.','','','','施法时有$s2%的几率忽视打断，受到攻击有几率恢复$45526s1点生命值。','',''),(45526,'Earth Shield','','','','大地之盾','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45527,'Water Shield','','','','水之护盾','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','The caster is surrounded by $n globes of water. When a spell, melee or ranged attack hits the caster, 130 mana is restored to the caster. This expends one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts $d. Only one elemental shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.','','','','施法者被 $n 个水球包围。当法术、近战或远程攻击击中施法者时，施法者会恢复 130 点法力。这会消耗一个水球。每隔几秒只有一个地球仪会激活。持续$d。萨满祭司在同一时间只能激活一个元素护盾。','','','Attacks and spells used against you restore 130 mana. $n charges.','','','','受到攻击有几率恢复$45528s1点法力值。','',''),(45528,'Water Shield','','','','水之护盾','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45529,'Calm Elements','','','','安抚元素','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Calms the target, reducing the range at which it will attack you by $s1 yards.  Only affects Elemental targets level $v or lower.  Lasts $d.','','','','安抚目标，使它的警戒范围减少$s1码。只对$v级及以下等级的目标有效。持续$d。','','','Reduced distance at which target will attack.','','','','减小目标的警戒范围。','',''),(45530,'Reduce Crit 1','','','','减少暴击1','','','','','','','','','','Reduces your chance to get critically hit by $s1%.','','','','减少你受到重击的几率 $s1%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45531,'Reduce Crit 2','','','','减少暴击2','','','','','','','','','','Reduces your chance to get critically hit by $s1%.','','','','减少你受到重击的几率 $s1%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45532,'Reduce Crit 3','','','','减少暴击3','','','','','','','','','','Reduces your chance to get critically hit by $s1%.','','','','减少你受到重击的几率 $s1%。','','','','','','','','',''),