itical strike with a Fire, Frost, or Nature damage spell or melee attack, you enter a Clearcasting state.  The Clearcasting state reduces the mana cost of your next 2 damage spells by 40%.','','','','在你的火焰、冰霜、自然伤害性法术或近战攻击造成致命一击后进入节能施法状态。这个状态可以使你接下来2个伤害性法术所消耗的法力值减少40%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45542,'Clearcasting','','','','节能施法','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Your next elemental damage spell has its mana cost reduced by $s1%.','','','','你的下一个元素伤害法术所消耗的法力值减少$s1%。','',''),(45543,'Arcane Vulnerability','','','','奥术漏洞','','','','','','','','','','Chance on landing a damaging spell to deal 75-85 Arcane damage and increase the target\'s Arcane damage taken by 10 for 15 sec. This stacks up to 3 times.','','','','有几率施展伤害性法术，造成 75-85 点奥术伤害，并使目标受到的奥术伤害增加 10 点，持续 15 秒。最多可叠加 3 次。','','','','','','','','',''),(45545,'Ancestral Guardian','','','','先祖守护','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Increases your armor value from items by $s1% and chance to dodge by an additional $s2%.','','','','使你因装备而获得的护甲值提高$s1%，并使你的躲闪几率增加$s2%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45546,'Ancestral Guardian','','','','先祖守护','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Increases your armor value from items by $s1% and chance to dodge by an additional $s2%.','','','','使你因装备而获得的护甲值提高$s1%，并使你的躲闪几率增加$s2%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45547,'Ancestral Guardian','','','','先祖守护','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Increases your armor value from items by $s1% and chance to dodge by an additional $s2%.','','','','使你因装备而获得的护甲值提高$s1%，并使你的躲闪几率增加$s2%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45548,'Ancestral Guardian','','','','先祖守护','','','Rank 4','','','','等级 4','','','Increases your armor value from items by $s1% and chance to dodge by an additional $s2%.','','','','使你因装备而获得的护甲值提高$s1%，并使你的躲闪几率增加$s2%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45549,'Ancestral Guardian','','','','先祖守护','','','Rank 5','','','','等级 5','','','Increases your armor value from items by $s1% and chance to dodge by an additional $s2%.','','','','使你因