m, you move $s3% slower than normal, but cannot perform any other abilities but you do not feel pity or remorse or fear and you cannot be stopped unless killed.','','','','攻击周围所有敌人，每$t1秒对它们造成武器伤害再加上$9633s1点额外伤害，持续$d。在此状态下你无法移动或使用技能，但你不会感到怜悯、悔恨或恐惧，除非被杀死，否则无法被阻止。','','','Attacking all nearby enemies in a whirlwind of steel.','','','','用钢铁般的旋风攻击附近的所有敌人。','',''),(45589,'Die by the Sword','','','','剑下亡魂','','','','','','','','','','Increases your chance to parry attacks by $s1% while under the effects of Retaliation.','','','','在反击风暴状态下你的招架几率提高$s1%。','','','Increased chance to parry by $s1%.','','','','招架几率增加$s1%。','',''),(45590,'Avatar','','','','天神下凡','','','','','','','','','','Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by $s1% and enhances its armor by $s2% for $d.','','','','使施法者造成的物理伤害提高$s1%，护甲值提高$s2%，持续$d。','','','Physical damage dealt is increased by $s1%.\nArmor increased by $s2%.','','','','对敌人造成的物理伤害提高$s1%。\n护甲值提高$s2%。','',''),(45591,'Dagger Mastery','','','','匕首掌握','','','Passive','','','','被动','','','Increases the normalized weapon speed to calculate damage of Daggers to 2.3 seconds.','','','','将计算匕首伤害的标准化武器速度提高到2.3秒。','','','','','','','','',''),(45592,'Pulverize','','','','粉碎','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Causes your melee attacks to have a 35% chance to deal $45593s1 damage to nearby enemies for 30 seconds.','','','','使你的近战攻击有35%的几率对附近的敌人造成$45593s1点伤害，持续30秒。','','','Chance to deal physical damage in an area around melee attack targets.','','','','近战攻击有几率对周围目标造成物理伤害。','',''),(45593,'Pulverize','','','','粉碎','','','','','','','','','','Causes $s1 damage to nearby enemies.','','','','对附近的敌人造成$s1点伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(45594,'Rallying Cry','','','','振奋咆哮','','','','','','','','','','A rallying cry that removes all Stun and Fear effects from party members within $a1 yards.','','','','消除$a1码范围内队伍成员的昏迷和恐惧效果。','','','','','','','','',''),(45595,'Intervene','','','','援护','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Run at high speed towards a party member, intercepting the next melee or ranged attack made against them.','','','','高速奔向队友，拦截下一次针对他们的近战或远程攻击。','','','The next melee or ranged attack made against you will be made against the intervening warrior instead.','','','','下一次对你的近战或远程攻击将由战士承担。','',''),(45596,'Spellsteal','','','','法术窃取','','','','','','','','','','Steals a beneficial magic effect from the target. This effect lasts a maximum of 2 min.','','','','从目标身上窃取一个增益魔法效果。这个效果最多持续 2 分钟。','','','','','','','','',''),(45597,'Gladiator Stance','','','','角斗士姿态','','','','','','','','','','A dauntless combat stance.\n\nIncreases your damage by $45598s1%.','','','','无畏的战斗姿态。\n\n使你的伤害增加$45598s1%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45598,'Gladiator Stance Passive','','','','角斗士姿态被动','','','','','','','','','','Increase physical damage done by $s1%.\nDecreases threat generated by $s3%.','','','','伤害增加$s1%。\n威胁减少$s3%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45599,'Decisive Strike','','','','果断一击','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Decisively strikes the opponent with the power of Slam (Rank 4), causing weapon damage plus $11605s1.','','','','用猛击（等级 4）的力量打击对手，造成的伤害增加$11605s1点。','','','Full credit for this ability\'s design goes to Wall of Wallcraft.','','','','这种能力的设计完全归功于Wallcraft之墙。','',''),(45600,'Shadow Strikes','','','','暗影打击','','','','','','','','','','All melee attacks against Poisoned targets cause additional Shadow damage equal to $45601s1% of weapon damage.','','','','所有对中毒目标的近战攻击都会造成额外的暗影伤害，数值相当于$45601s1%的武器伤害。','','','Melee attacks against Poisoned or Dazed targets cause additional Shadow damage equal to $45601s1% of weapon damage.','','','','对中毒或眩晕目标的近战攻击造成额外的暗影伤害，数值相当于$45601s1%的武器伤害。','',''),(45601,'Shadow Strikes','','','','暗影打击','','','','','','','','','','Deals $s1% of weapon damage as shadow damage.','','','','造成相当于武器伤害$s1%的暗影伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(45602,'Fan of Knives','','','','刀扇','','','','','','','','','','Sprays knives at up to 5 targets within 8 yards, dealing ranged weapon damage.','