ng the use of ranged weapons and abilities.  Only one Aspect can be active at a time.','','','','猎人获得孤狼守护，增加$s1点近战攻击力，但禁止使用远程武器和技能。一个猎人在同一时间内只能激活一种守护。','','','Increases melee attack power by $s1.','','','','增加$s1点近战攻击力。','',''),(45651,'Aspect of the Fox','','','','狐狸守护','','','','','','','','','','The hunter takes on the aspects of a fox, allowing for casting of stationary ranged attacks while moving, but reducing damage done by $s1%.  Only one Aspect can be active at a time.','','','','猎人获得狐狸守护，可以进行移动射击，但伤害减少$s1%。一个猎人在同一时间内只能激活一种守护。','','','Able to cast while moving. Ranged damage reduced by $s1%.','','','','可以进行移动射击，但伤害减少$s1%。','',''),(45652,'Aspect of the Snake','','','','蝰蛇守护','','','','','','','','','','The hunter takes on the aspects of a snake, causing most melee attacks and ranged auto attacks to have a chance to restore $45664s1 mana.  Only one Aspect can be active at a time.','','','','猎人获得蝰蛇守护，使近战和远程攻击有几率回复$45664s1点法力值。一个猎人在同一时间内只能激活一种守护。','','','Restoring mana from most attacks.','','','','攻击时有几率回复法力。','',''),(45653,'Lacerate','','','','撕裂','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 21% of your melee attack power over $d.','','','','使目标的伤口不断流血，在$d内造成你近战攻击力21%的伤害。','','','Bleeding every $t1 seconds.','','','','每$t1秒流血一次。','',''),(45654,'Lacerate','','','','撕裂','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 35% of your melee attack power over $d.','','','','使目标的伤口不断流血，在$d内造成你近战攻击力35%的伤害。','','','Bleeding every $t1 seconds.','','','','每$t1秒流血一次。','',''),(45655,'Lacerate','','','','撕裂','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 49% of your melee attack power over $d.','','','','使目标的伤口不断流血，在$d内造成你近战攻击力49%的伤害。','','','Bleeding every $t1 seconds.','','','','每$t1秒流血一次。','',''),(45656,'Lacerate','','','','撕裂','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Deal damage equal to on $s1% of melee attack power.','','','','造成相当于近战攻击力%s1%的伤害','','','','','','','','','