 1','','','Most ranged and melee attacks to have a chance to restore $s1 mana. ','','','','近战和远程攻击有几率回复$s1点法力值。','','','Restoring mana from most attacks.','','','','攻击时有几率回复法力。','',''),(45665,'Arcane Channeling','','','','奥术引导','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45666,'Hammer of Justice Cooldown Reduction 5','','','','正义之锤冷却时间缩短 5','','','','','','','','','','Decreases the cooldown of your Hammer of Justice spell by $/1000;s1 sec.','','','','将正义之锤法术的冷却时间缩短 $/1000；s1 秒。','','','','','','','','',''),(45700,'Nature\'s Call','','','','大自然的召唤','','','Summon','','','','召唤','','','Summons a faerie dragon from the Emerald Dream to assist the Druid.','','','','从翡翠梦境召唤精灵龙协助德鲁伊。','','','','','','','','',''),(45701,'Nature\'s Call','','','','大自然的召唤','','','Summon','','','','召唤','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45702,'Mana Flare','','','','法力爆燃','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Channel negative magical energies into an area that deals $s1 arcane damage to nearby enemies when they cast spells.','','','','创建一个负魔区域，区域内的敌人施法时受到$s1点奥术伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(45703,'Mana Flare','','','','法力爆燃','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','','','','','','','','Damaging enemies on spellcast.','','','','对施法的敌人造成伤害。','',''),(45704,'Mana Flare','','','','法力爆燃','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45705,'Tree of Life Form','','','','生命之树形态','','','Shapeshift','','','','变形','','','Shapeshift into the Tree of Life.  While in this form the healing power of nearby party members is increased by an amount equal to $45707s1% of your spirit, your movement speed is reduced by $45706s2%, and you cannot cast damaging spells or Healing Touch, but the mana cost of heal over time spells is reduced by 20%.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.','','','','变形为生命之树。在这种形态下，附近队友的治疗能力会增加相当于你精神值$45707s1%的量，你的移动速度会降低$45706s2%，并且你不能施放伤害性法术或治疗之触，但随着时间的推移治疗法术减少 20%。变形行为可以使施法者摆脱变形和运动障碍效果。','','','Immune to Polymorph effects. ','','','','免疫变形效果。','',''),(45706,'Tree of Life Form (Passive)','','','','生命之树形态（被动）','','','Passive','','','','被动','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(45707,'Tree of Life Aura','','','','生命之树光环','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Increases healing done.','','','','增加治疗效果。','',''),(45708,'Berserk','','','','狂暴','','','','','','','','','','Removes all Fear effects and increases your energy regeneration rate by 100% while in Cat form, and increases your total health by 20% while in Bear form. After the effect ends, the health is lost. Effect lasts 20 seconds.','','','','猎豹形态下移除所有恐惧效果并提高100%能量回复。熊形态下提高20%生命值上限，效果结束扣除生命值。持续时间20秒。','','','','','','','','',''),(45709,'Berserk','','','','狂暴','','','','','','','','','','Going Bear-serk','','','','大展熊风','','','Health increased by 20% of maximum.','','','','提高20%生命值上限。','',''),(45710,'Berserk','','','','狂暴','','','','','','','','','','Maybe I\'m a Lion','','','','我即是雄狮','','','Energy regeneration rate increased by $s1%.','','','','能量回复提高$s1%。','','');
