无法动作，但也无法被攻击，持续最多$d秒。德鲁伊在同一时间内只能对一个目标使用旋风。','','','','','','','','',''),(45743,'Improved Starfire','','','','强化星火术','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Reduces the cast time of Starfire by $/1000;S2 sec and has a $h% chance to stun the target for $16922d.','','','','星火术的施法时间减少$/1000;S2秒，并有$h%的机会击晕目标，持续$16922d。','','','','','','','','',''),(45744,'Improved Starfire','','','','强化星火术','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Reduces the cast time of Starfire by $/1000;S2 sec and has a $h% chance to stun the target for $16922d.','','','','星火术的施法时间减少$/1000;S2秒，并有$h%的机会击晕目标，持续$16922d。','','','','','','','','',''),(45745,'Improved Starfire','','','','强化星火术','','','Rank 3','','','','等级 3','','','Reduces the cast time of Starfire by $/1000;S2 sec and has a $h% chance to stun the target for $16922d.','','','','星火术的施法时间减少$/1000;S2秒，并有$h%的机会击晕目标，持续$16922d。','','','','','','','','',''),(45799,'Elune\'s Grace','','','','艾露恩的赐福','','','','','','','','','','Restores mana.','','','','恢复法力。','','','','','','','','',''),(45800,'Ardent Defender','','','','炽热防御者','','','Passive','','','','被动','','','When you have less than 35% health, all damage taken is reduced by 25%.','','','','当你的生命值低于35%时，你承受的所有伤害降低25%。','','','','','','','','',''),(45801,'Greater Blessing of Sacrifice','','','','强效牺牲祝福','','','','','','','','','','Places a seal on a party member, causing the caster to split $s1% of all damage taken by that party member. Damage cannot be mitigated. Lasts $d.','','','','对一名小队成员施加祝福，该成员受到的所有伤害的$s1%由施法者承担。伤害无法减免。持续$d。','','','Splitting $s1% of all damage taken by a party member.','','','','承担一名小队成员受到的所有伤害的$s1%。','',''),(45802,'Seal of the Martyr','','','','殉难圣印','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','All melee attacks deal additional Holy damage equal to $s1% of normal weapon damage, but the Paladin loses health equal to $s2% of the total damage inflicted. \n\nUnleashing this Seal\'s energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing $45816s1 Holy damage at the cost of health equal to 33% of