 an improved Invisibility state.\n\nFelhunter - Dispels all magical effects from the Felhunter.','','','','强化术士所召唤的恶魔。\n\n小鬼 - 使小鬼的法术暴击几率提高20%，持续30秒。\n\n虚空行者 - 使虚空行者的生命值提高20%，其法术和攻击产生的威胁值提高20%，持续20秒。\n\n魅魔 - 立即消失，使魅魔进入强化的隐身状态。\n\n地狱犬 - 驱散地狱犬的所有魔法效果。','','','Empowered.','','','','授权。','',''),(45910,'Mana Funnel','','','','法力通道','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Transfers $s1 mana from the caster to $ghis:her; pet every second as long as the caster channels.','','','','只要施法者保持着引导法术的状态，就会每秒钟将$s1点法力值转移给$g他:她;的宠物。','','','Transferring Mana.','','','','转移法力。','',''),(45911,'Mana Funnel','','','','法力通道','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Transfers $s1 mana from the caster to $ghis:her; pet every second as long as the caster channels.','','','','只要施法者保持着引导法术的状态，就会每秒钟将$s1点法力值转移给$g他:她;的宠物。','','','Transferring Mana.','','','','转移法力。','',''),(45912,'Demon Portal Effect','','','','恶魔之门效果','','','','','','','','','','Summons a Felguard.','','','','召唤一个恶魔守卫。','','','','','','','','',''),(45913,'Soul Siphon','','','','灵魂虹吸','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','Increases the Health drained by your Drain Life spell by $s1% and causes 15% of the Mana drained by your Drain Mana spell to damage the opponent.','','','','使吸取生命的吸取量提高$s1%，使吸取法力对目标造成吸取量15%的伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(45914,'Soul Siphon','','','','灵魂虹吸','','','Rank 2','','','','等级 2','','','Increases the Health drained by your Drain Life spell by $s1% and causes 30% of the Mana drained by your Drain Mana spell to damage the opponent.','','','','使吸取生命的吸取量提高$s1%，使吸取法力对目标造成吸取量15%的伤害。','','','','','','','','',''),(45915,'Carrion Swarm','','','','腐臭虫群','','','Rank 1','','','','等级 1','','','A wave of demonic bats and chaotic magic releases over enemies in a cone infront of the caster, dealing $s1 Shadow damage and an additional $s2 Shadow damage every $t2 sec. for $d.','','','','对前方扇形区域的敌人造成$s1点暗影伤害，并每$t2秒造成额外$s2点暗影伤害，持续$d。','','','Suffering $s2 Shadow damage every $t2 sec.','','','','每$t2秒造成$s2点暗影伤害。','',''),(45916,