n Goblin Shredder','','','','绿色地精伐木机','','','','','','','','','','The destructive nature of goblins is best characterized by their shredders.','','','','地精的破坏性本质最能体现在它们的粉碎机上。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46506,'Red Spidertank','','','','红色蜘蛛坦克','','','','','','','','','','Four-legged machine of destruction, for your riding pleasure.','','','','四足毁灭机器，为你带来骑行乐趣。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46507,'Black Spidertank','','','','黑色蜘蛛坦克','','','','','','','','','','Smoky, sparky, and loud.','','','','烟雾缭绕、闪闪发光、响亮。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46508,'Blue Spidertank','','','','蓝色蜘蛛坦克','','','','','','','','','','The check engine light is always on, it\'s when it goes off that you should be worried.','','','','检查发动机灯始终亮起，只有当它熄灭时您才应该担心。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46509,'Green Spidertank','','','','绿色蜘蛛坦克','','','','','','','','','','This mechaspider specializes in drilling, clamping, and shooting at the same time. A typical gnome invention.','','','','这款机械蜘蛛擅长同时钻孔、夹紧和射击。典型的侏儒发明。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46510,'Black Pounder','','','','黑色重炮','','','','','','','','','','A fearsome war machine, built to withstand the harshest of battles.','','','','可怕的战争机器，专为承受最严酷的战斗而打造。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46511,'Blue Pounder','','','','蓝色重炮','','','','','','','','','','A fearsome war machine, built to withstand the harshest of battles.','','','','可怕的战争机器，专为承受最严酷的战斗而打造。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(46512,'Green Pounder','','','','绿色重炮','','','','','','','','','','A fearsome war machine, built to withstand the harshest of battles.','','','','可怕的战争机器，专为承受最严酷的战斗而打造。','','','Increases speed b