,'吱吱','','','','','','','','','','Annoying and destructive, they can be coaxed with enough cheese to become a tolerable companion.','','','','它们既烦人又具有破坏性，可以用足够的奶酪来哄它们，使其成为一个可以忍受的伴侣。','','','','','','','','',''),(49505,'Lil\' Tinyfin','','','','鱼人宝宝','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss Tinyfin!','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散鱼人宝宝!','','','','','','','','',''),(49506,'Mr. Tails','','','','尾巴先生','','','','','','','','','','Save up on acorns along the way and share some undivided attention & love with Mr.Tails and he\'ll be the best companion on your long journey through Azeroth.','','','','一路上节省一些橡子，并与尾巴先生分享一些全心全意的关注和爱，他将成为你穿越艾泽拉斯的漫长旅程中最好的伴侣。','','','Save up on acorns along the way and share some undivided attention & love with Mr.Tails and he\'ll be the best companion on your long journey through Azeroth.','','','','在旅途中收集橡子与尾巴先生分享并给予他关注和爱护，他将成为你穿越艾泽拉斯的漫长旅程中的最佳伴侣。','',''),(49507,'Sammy!','','','','萨米！','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss Sammy!','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散山米！','','','','','','','','',''),(49508,'Gilnean Raven','','','','乌鸦','','','','','','','','','','For generations, the ravens of Gilneas have served as a timeless symbol of regal authority, reminding all of the lasting influence of House Greymane, even in the darkest of nights.','','','','世世代代以来，吉尔尼斯的乌鸦一直是王权的永恒象征，提醒所有人格雷迈恩家族的持久影响，即使在最黑暗的夜晚也是如此。','','','','','','','','',''),(49509,'Tiny Warp Stalker','','','','小迁跃捕猎者','','','','','','','','','','Not only is it quick, it\'s loud too!','','','','不仅速度快，而且声音也很大！','','','','','','','','',''),(49510,'SC-0-TT1','','','','SC-0-TT1','','','','','','','','','','Unique and intelligent piece of genius engineering!','','','','独特而智能的天才工程！','','','','','','','','',''),(49511,'Flipper','','','','菲利普','','','','','','','','','','Notable for its wide eyes and sassy slide.','','','','以其大眼睛和时髦的幻灯片而闻名。','','','','','','','','',''),(49512,'Pengu','','','','企鹅','','','','','','','','','','It\'s appearance evokes a more civilized era, when duelists battled in tuxedos.','','','','它的外观让人想起一个更加文明的时代，当时决斗者穿着燕尾服进行战斗。','','','','','','','','',''),(49513,'Midnight','','','','午夜','','','','','','','','','','Ride with the moon (and this furry, whiskered witch) in the dead of night!','','','','在夜深人静的时候与月亮（还有这个毛茸茸的、长着胡须的女巫）一起骑行！','','','','','','','','',''),(49514,'Glitterwing','','','','闪光之翼','','','','','','','','','','These flying creatures do not leave feathers out in the wild. If a feather happens to ever detach from their body, the feather glows brilliantly for a moment and then vanishes from sight.','','','','这些飞行的生物不会在野外留下羽毛。如果一根羽毛碰巧从他们的身体上脱落，羽毛会发出短暂的光芒，然后从视线中消失。','','','','','','','','',''),(49515,'Spectral Cub','','','','光谱幼崽','','','','','','','','','','Affectionate and curious, these kittens seem to find the most peculiar hiding places.','','','','这些小猫充满感情和好奇，似乎找到了最奇特的藏身之处。','','','','','','','','',''),(49516,'Kruxis','','','','克鲁西斯','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss Kruxis.','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散克鲁西斯。','','','','','','','','',''),(49517,'Lovely Pink Fox','','','','可爱的粉红色狐狸','','','','','','','','','','A shy creature, the pink fox will only make its presence known to those that have befriended it.','','','','粉红狐狸是一种害羞的生物，只会让那些与它成为朋友的人知道它的存在。','','','','','','','','',''),(49518,'Unholy Toy Staff','','','','邪恶的玩具法杖','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss your unholy toy weapon.','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散你的邪恶的玩具武器。','','','','','','','','',''),(49519,'Unholy Toy Axe','','','','邪恶的玩具斧头','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss your unholy toy weapon.','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散你的邪恶的玩具武器。','','','','','','','','',''),(49520,'Young Mutant Warturtle','','','','小变异疣龟','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss your warturtle.','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散你的疣龟。','','','','','','','','',''),(49521,'Wyvern Roost Hatchling','','','','双足飞龙幼崽','','','','','','','','','','Even in this tiny form, the wyvern is fierce.','','','','即使是这种微小的形态，双足飞龙也很凶猛。','','','','','','','','',''),(49522,'Companion Pet [PH]','','','','Companion Pet [PH]','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss your companion.','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散你的companion。','','','','','','','','',''),(49523,'Lazy Peon','','','','懒惰的苦工','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss your lazy peon.','','','','右键单击以召唤或解散你的懒惰的苦工。','','','','','','','','',''),(49524,'Call of Sul\'thraze','','','','苏萨雷兹的召唤','','','','','','','','','','Combines Jang\'thraze and Sang\'thraze to form the mighty sword, Sul\'thraze.','','','','将 Jang\\\'thraze 和 Sang\\\'thraze 结合形成强大的剑 Sul\\\'thraze。','','','','','','','','',''),(49525,'Call of Blades','','','','刀锋召唤','','','','','','','','','','Conjures the dual blades of Sul\'thraze.','','','','召唤出苏萨泽的双刃。','','','','','','','','',''),(49526,'Schematic: Thorium Grenade','','','','结构图：瑟银手榴弹','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(49527,'Schematic: Thorium Widget','','','','结构图：瑟银小部件','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(49528,'Schematic: Truesilver Transformer','','','','结构图：真银变压器','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(50000,'Slow & Steady','','','','龟速模式','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','Gaining 50% fewer experience points from defeating enemies. Lose 5% of accumulated experience from current level upon being defeated by enemies.','','','','击杀敌人获得的经验减少50%。被敌人击败时，损失当前等级5%的经验值。','','','Taking it easy.','','','','放轻松。','',''),(50001,'Hardcore','','','','硬核模式','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','Upon death your spirit is lost to the Twisting Nether, unable to ever return to the Material Plane.','','','','死亡后，你的灵魂将迷失在扭曲虚空，无法再回到物质位面。','','','Consider yourself born again hardcore!','','','','把自己视为一条命的硬核模式！','',''),(50002,'Survivalist','','','','生存主义者','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','More easily wethered by the elements.  Must overcome hunger, thirst, encumbrance, temperature, tiredness, sickness, and injury in order to survive.','','','','更容易受环境影响。必须克服饥饿、口渴、负重、温度、疲劳、疾病和伤痛才能生存。','','','Roughing it.','','','','艰苦求生。','',''),(50003,'Twinking','','','','锁级','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','No longer gaining experience points from any source.','','','','不再从任何来源获得经验值。','','','Not gaining experience.','','','','没有经验获取。','',''),(50004,'Exhaustion','','','','疲倦','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','No longer gaining rested experience.','','','','不再获得休息经验。','','','You feel normal. All the time.','','','','你将一直保持正常状态。','',''),(50005,'Diplomat','','','','外交官','','','Perk','','','','Perk','','','As a diplomat, you have proved to be aware of the real issues. You now know how to speak with the other faction and are allowed to trade and group with them.','','','','可以与其他势力交谈，并与他们进行交易和组队。','','','','','','','','',''),(50006,'Hardcore','','','','硬核模式','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','Upon death your spirit is lost to the Twisting Nether, unable to ever return to the Material Plane.','','','','死亡后，你的灵魂将迷失在扭曲虚空，无法再回到物质位面。','','','Enables the Hardcore challenge.','','','','开启硬核模式挑战。','',''),(50007,'Lone Wolf','','','','独狼','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','Trading with players and use of the Auction House are disabled.\n\nRestricted  from grouping with other players. \n\nCannot craft gear.\n\nCannot use consumables other than health potions.\n\nAutomatically revive at a graveyard upon death.','','','','禁止与玩家交易和使用拍卖行。\n\n限制与其他玩家组队。 \n\n无法制作装备。\n\n不能使用生命药水以外的消耗品。\n\n死后自动在墓地复活。','','','Going your own way.','','','','孤身上路。','',''),(50008,'War Mode','','','','战争模式','','','Challenge','','','','挑战','','','You can no longer disable PvP mode but experience and honor gains from all sources are increased by 20%.','','','','你不能再禁用PvP，但增加了从所有来源获得的经验。','','','Permanently flagged for PvP.','','','','永久标记为PvP。','',''),(50009,'Baxxil','','','','巴克西尔','','','','','','','','','','Right Click to summon and dismiss your Baxxil.','','','','右键单击召唤或解散你的 Baxxil。','','','','',''