','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(50055,'Scarlet Charger','','','','猩红战马','','','','','','','','','','It is often ridden by those who seek to inspire fear in their enemies.','','','','那些试图激起敌人恐惧的人经常骑乘它。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(50056,'Kul Tiran Warhorse','','','','库尔提拉斯战马','','','','','','','','','','The Kul Tiran Warhorse is a sturdy and reliable mount, bred for battle and unafraid of danger. Its massive size and strength make it a formidable ally in combat.','','','','库尔提拉斯战马是一匹坚固可靠的坐骑，专为战斗而生，不惧危险。其巨大的体型和力量使其成为战斗中强大的盟友。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(50057,'Greymane Charger','','','','格雷迈恩战马','','','','','','','','','','The Greymane Charger is a symbol of the Gilnean strength and resilience. Its sleek, silver coat and lightning-fast speed make it a favorite among Gilnean soldiers.','','','','格雷迈恩战马是吉尔尼斯力量和韧性的象征。它光滑的银色皮毛和闪电般的速度使其成为吉尔尼斯士兵的最爱。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(50058,'Brown Zhevra','','','','棕斑斑羚','','','','','','','','','','The Brown Zhevra is a swift and sure-footed mount, able to navigate even the roughest terrain with ease. Its striped coat and graceful movements make it a popular choice among adventurers.','','','','棕斑斑马是一种敏捷且脚步稳健的坐骑，即使在最崎岖的地形上也能轻松穿行。它的条纹皮毛和优美的动作使其成为冒险家们的热门选择。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(50059,'Grim Totem Kodo','','','','冷酷图腾科多兽','','','','','','','','','','The Grim Totem Kodo is a massive, hulking beast, feared by many for its sheer size and strength. Those who ride it are said to have the power of the earth at their command.','','','','冷酷图腾科多兽是一种巨大而笨重的野兽，因其庞大的体型和力量而令许多人感到恐惧。据说那些骑着它的人可以掌控大地的力量。','','','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.','','','','根据您的骑行技能提高速度。','',''),(50060,'Baxxil Dummy','','','','巴克希尔假人','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(50061,'Gnome Racing Car',