'','','',''),(57204,'Poison Frog','','','','毒蛙','','','','','','','','','','Beware the vibrant hues of this deadly amphibian, as its skin secretes a potent toxin capable of incapacitating even the mightiest of foes.','','','','小心这种致命的两栖动物鲜艳的色彩，因为它的皮肤会分泌一种强效毒素，即使是最强大的敌人也能丧失能力。','','','','','','','','',''),(57205,'Snow Frog','','','','雪蛙','','','','','','','','','','Native to the frigid regions of Azeroth, this hardy frog has adapted to survive in icy environments, its azure skin camouflaging it against the snowy landscapes.','','','','这种耐寒的青蛙原产于艾泽拉斯的寒冷地区，已经适应了在冰冷的环境中生存，它蔚蓝的皮肤在白雪皑皑的环境中显得很隐蔽。','','','','','','','','',''),(57206,'Pink Frog','','','','粉红青蛙','','','','','','','','','','Delicate and enchanting, this rare frog species captivates with its vibrant pink hue, believed to bring good fortune and prosperity to its owner.','','','','这种稀有的青蛙品种精致而迷人，以其充满活力的粉红色调而令人着迷，相信可以为其主人带来好运和繁荣。','','','','','','','','',''),(57207,'Golden Frog','','','','金蛙','','','','','','','','','','Legend has it that this shimmering amphibian is a harbinger of wealth and abundance.','','','','传说这种闪闪发光的两栖动物是财富和丰富的预兆。','','','','','','','','',''),(57208,'Pond Frog','','','','池塘青蛙','','','','','','','','','','A common sight in tranquil ponds and marshes, this unassuming frog is a reminder of the simple joys found in nature\'s embrace.','','','','这种谦逊的青蛙在宁静的池塘和沼泽中很常见，它提醒人们在大自然的怀抱中发现简单的快乐。','','','','','','','','',''),(57518,'Eternal Dreamstone Shard','','','','永恒梦境碎片','','','','','','','','','','The combining of dream fragments can only be done at a moonwell, and only ocassionally will the waters permit themselves to be used in such a way.','','','','梦境碎片的结合只能在月井中完成，而水也只是偶尔才会允许自己以这种方式使用。','','','','','','','','',''),(57519,'Formula: Eternal Dreamstone Shard','','','','公式：永恒梦境碎片','','','','','','','','','','Teaches you how to create an Eternal Dreamstate Essence.','','','','教你如何制作永恒梦境精华。','','','','','','','','',''),(57530,'Add Recording to Collection','','','','将录音添加到集合中','','','Collection','',''